{
  "category": "Kite Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "As it majestically swims, it doesn't care if REMORAID attach to it for scavenging its leftovers.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Swimming freely in open seas, it may fly out of the water and over the waves if it builds up enough speed.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "It swims along freely, eating things that swim into its mouth. Its whole body is very coarse.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "On sunny days, schools of MANTINE can be seen elegantly leaping over the sea’s waves. This POKéMON is not bothered by the REMORAID that hitches rides.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
