    {
      "text": "When the waves are calm, one may encounter a swarm of MANTINE swimming as if they are in flight.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "It swims elegantly, mindless of REMORAID hitching on to its broad fins. It has a docile nature.",
