    {
      "text": "Postcards and posters featuring Mantine leaping elegantly above the waves are popular souvenirs of Alola.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Many people have taken up surfing because they admire how magnificently Mantine swims.",
